    "html": "\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"es\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <title>Presupuesto</title>\n  <style>\n   @page {\n  size: A4;\n  margin: 20mm;\n}\n\nbody {\n  font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;\n  background: #fff;\n  color: #333;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n  width: 210mm;\n  height: 297mm;\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n\n.container {\n  width: 100%;\n  padding: 20mm;\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  background: #fff;\n}\n\n.header, .section {\n  page-break-inside: avoid;\n}\n\n.header {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n}\n\n.header h1 {\n  font-size: 28px;\n  color: #ff6d5a;\n  margin: 0;\n}\n\n.aclaraciones-box {\n  background: #fffbe6;\n  padding: 16px;\n  margin: 12px 0 20px 0;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  color: #333;\n  font-weight: bold;\n}\n\n.company-info, .client-info {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n}\n\n.logo-container {\n  flex: 0 0 auto;\n  text-align: center;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n}\n\n.logo-container img {\n  max-width: 120px;\n  max-height: 80px;\n  object-fit: contain;\n}\n\n.section-title {\n  font-size: 18px;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  color: #555;\n  margin-bottom: 12px;\n  border-left: 6px solid #ff6d5a;\n  padding-left: 10px;\n}\n\ntable {\n  width: 100%;\n  border-collapse: collapse;\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n\nth, td {\n  padding: 8px 12px;\n  border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\n  text-align: left;\n  font-size: 14px;\n  min-width: 50px;\n}\n\nth {\n  background: #f9f9f9;\n}\n\n.totales-table td {\n  padding: 8px 12px;\n}\n\n.totales {\n  width: 100px;\n  text-align: right;\n}\n\n.precios-derecha {\n  text-align: right;\n}\n\n.total-final {\n  background: #ff6d5a;\n  color: #fff;\n  padding: 12px;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  font-size: 20px;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  text-align: right;\n}\n\n.footer {\n  text-align: center;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  color: #888;\n  margin-top: 32px;\n}\n\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 24px; gap: 16px;\">\n      \n      <!-- Columna izquierda: Empresa -->\n      <div class=\"company-info\" style=\"flex: 1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4;\">\n        <strong>Probelt SRL</strong><br>\n        I.V.A. Responsable Inscripto<br>\n        C.U.I.T.: 30-71154454-9<br>\n        Ingresos Brutos: CM<br>\n        Buenos Aires, Argentina<br>\n        Tel: 901-552691-7<br>\n        WhatsApp: +54 11 5419-6220<br>\n        www.bairescocina.com\n      </div>\n    \n      <!-- Columna centro: Logo -->\n      <div class=\"logo-container\">\n        <img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"Logo\" />\n      </div>\n    \n      <!-- Columna derecha: Cliente -->\n      <div class=\"client-info\" style=\"flex: 1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; text-align: right; align-self: flex-start;\">\n        <strong>Cliente:</strong> Facundo<br>\n        <strong>Razón Social:</strong> <br>\n        <strong>Domicilio:</strong> Mi Casa 123<br>\n        <strong>Teléfono:</strong> 3548123123<br>\n        <strong>CUIT:</strong> 345906323\n      </div>\n    \n    </div>\n    \n    <!-- Título debajo -->\n    <h1 style=\"text-align: center; color: #ff6d5a; font-size: 28px; margin-top: 12px;\">Presupuesto</h1>\n\n    <div class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"section-title\">Detalle de ítems</div>\n      <table>\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th>Cod.</th>\n            <th>Descripción</th>\n            <th>Cant.</th>\n            <th>Precio Un.</th>\n            <th>% DTO</th>\n            <th>Neto</th>\n            <th>IVA</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          \n    <tr>\n      <td>NAG161B</td>\n      <td>Naboo 5.0</td>\n      <td>1</td>\n      <td class=precios-derecha >$30.908,80</td>\n      <td>0%</td>\n      <td class=precios-derecha >$30.908,80</td>\n      <td class=precios-derecha >$3.245,42</td>\n    </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>SSP061</td>\n        <td>Suplemento para estructura portaplatos extraíble, completa de bastidor de introducción</td>\n        <td>2</td>\n        <td class=precios-derecha >$990,08</td>\n        <td>0%</td>\n        <td class=precios-derecha >$1.980,16</td>\n        <td class=precios-derecha >$207,92</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>NPS2</td>\n        <td>Puerta con bisagra a la derecha, dotada de sonda al corazón multipunto con conector externo, ø 3 mm</td>\n        <td>1</td>\n        <td class=precios-derecha >$967,20</td>\n        <td>0%</td>\n        <td class=precios-derecha >$967,20</td>\n        <td class=precios-derecha >$101,56</td>\n      </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"section-title\">Resumen final</div>\n      <table class=\"totales-table\">\n        <tr><td><strong>Subtotal (sin descuentos):</strong></td><td class=\"totales\">$33.856,16</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><strong>Subtotal con descuentos por ítem:</strong></td><td class=\"totales\">$33.856,16</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><strong>Descuento general:</strong></td><td class=\"totales\">0%</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><strong>Descuento general aplicado:</strong></td><td class=\"totales\">$0,00</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><strong>Subtotal final:</strong></td><td class=\"totales\">$33.856,16</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><strong>IVA total:</strong></td><td class=\"totales\">$3.554,90</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    \n\n    <div class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"section-title\">Total final</div>\n      <div class=\"total-final\">$37.411,06</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"footer\">\n      Gracias por tu confianza. Para más información contáctanos.\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
  }
